{"1348400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Dust", "steam_appid": 1348400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Top-Down Shooter Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Dust</strong> is a top-down action shooter set in a harsh sci-fi frontier where survival depends on fast reflexes and precise gunplay. Players fight through hostile environments filled with enemies, hazards, and high-pressure combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on immediate action, tight controls, and constant movement rather than slow or turn-based mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill-Driven Combat and Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Red Dust rewards accuracy, positioning, and quick decision-making. Encounters are designed to keep players engaged with frequent enemy waves and escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between firefights, players explore dangerous locations, uncovering new areas and challenges while pushing deeper into the hostile world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Gritty Science-Fiction Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Dust blends science fiction with western-inspired themes, creating a rough, unforgiving tone. The environments emphasize isolation and danger, reinforcing the feeling of being alone on a hostile frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>combat-focused, single-player experience</strong> built for players who enjoy constant action and mechanical mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down action shooter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, skill-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi setting with western influences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-driven level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat-focused single-player experience</p></li><li><p class